{"synopsis":"Protagonisnya, Liang Qu, bertransmigrasi ke dunia bernama Da Shun. Ketika dia dijebak dan jatuh ke dalam krisis, dia secara ajaib membangunkan sistem yang disebut “Ze Ding”, dan segalanya berubah! Sang protagonis akan menyatu dengan garis keturunan binatang dewa kuno, mendapatkan kekuatan yang sangat besar, meningkatkan bakatnya, dan bahkan memperoleh keterampilan prajurit yang seperti dewa. Ayo pergi! Menyatu dengan garis keturunan Ze Ling!\n\nSistem: “Membangkitkan garis keturunan Ze Ling—Monyet Air.”\nProtagonis: “???”","alternative_title":"从水猴子开始成神","author":"黑风寨大当家","artist":"黑风寨大当家","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c61f7b48-540b-489f-9a5b-268925611cb5","number":"77","chapter":"77","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_77/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_77/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_77/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_77/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_77/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_77/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_77/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_77/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_77/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_77/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"f01be537-e6a4-4283-91fb-4f4f2949c00a","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"","date":"2026-07-16","released":"2026-07-16","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_14371c6c-d6ba-4d6e-a48a-f8feff4bff40/chapter_ch_76/1.webp","htt